OL,3,GNEWSABus operator 'very sorry' for
OL,4,Arecent disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's bus operator, Stagecoach,
OL,7,Fhas apologised for recent service
OL,8,Fdisruption.
OL,10,FSome bus users had complained about a
OL,11,Fnew timetable which they said led to
OL,12,Flong waits, cancellations and the bus
OL,13,Fapp not updating with changes.
OL,15,FStagecoach said two major road closures
OL,16,Fand schools returning after the summer
OL,17,Fhad contributed to the issues with the
OL,18,Fnew schedule, which was made in
OL,19,Fpartnership with the States of
OL,20,FGuernsey.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
