OL,3,GNEWSABus operator 'very sorry' for
OL,4,Arecent disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FStagecoach South West managing director
OL,7,FPeter Knight said he was "very sorry"
OL,8,Ffor any disrupted journeys or
OL,9,Finconvenience which he said were
OL,10,F"regrettable".
